{'symbol': 'MLM', 'date': '2022-03-24 16:30:00', 'title': 'MARTIN MARIETTA TO SELL COLORADO AND CENTRAL TEXAS READY MIXED CONCRETE OPERATIONS TO SMYRNA', 'text': 'RALEIGH, N.C., MARCH 24, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MARTIN MARIETTA MATERIALS, INC. (NYSE: MLM) (“MARTIN MARIETTA” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO SELL ITS COLORADO AND CENTRAL TEXAS READY MIXED CONCRETE OPERATIONS TO SMYRNA READY MIX CONCRETE LLC.'}